      "id": "2afa79a14d7b2be912ce25b63755b9fa0aa38b16",
      "short_id": "2afa79a1",
      "created_at": "2021-05-06T11:37:57.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "5af925e013d57e262f8056200623dcaf31dfca51"
      ],
      "title": "PFCP: fix UE IP address Pool Identity",
      "message": "PFCP: fix UE IP address Pool Identity\n\nFix multiple problems with UE IP address Pool Identity\n* the length of the length field needs to be added to offset\n* the length field is two bytes long\n* the bitmask on the lenght field is wrong\n* add \"Length\" to the description of the length field\n* decode UE IP address Pool Identity as string\n\nDecoding the field as string makes sense because it originates from\na DIAMETER attrbiute that would usually also be decoded as string.\n",
      "author_name": "Andreas Schultz",
      "author_email": "andreas.schultz@travelping.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-04-26T16:18:11.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-05-06T11:37:57.000+00:00",
